### 8.4 Update Behavior

The future catalog update system must support:

- Automatic update checks.
- Manual refresh.
- Local caching.
- Version comparison.
- ETag support where available.
- Conditional requests.
- Last-Modified support where available.
- Small response sizes.
- Safe JSON parsing.
- Schema validation.
- Atomic updates.
